<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Vibhuti Narayan Singh</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1927">1927</a>–<a href="/years/2000">2000</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Vibhuti Narayan Singh was the last ruling <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/maharaja">Maharaja</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/varanasi">Benares</a>, succeeding in 1939 while still a boy. He acceded to the Indian Union after independence, and in 1949 Benares State was merged into <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/uttar-pradesh">Uttar Pradesh</a>. He remained a respected patron of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hinduism">Hindu</a> learning and of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sanskrit">Sanskrit</a> scholarship, and continued to preside over the month-long <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ramnagar-ramlila">Ramnagar Ramlila</a> staged at his family's fort.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/vibhuti-narayan-singh.jpg" alt="Vibhuti Narayan Singh" width="320" height="470" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Unknown author · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Maharaja_Vibhuti_Narayan_Singh_of_Banaras.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
<section class="enc-quotes"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Across the Institute</h2><ul><li><blockquote><b>Vibhuti Narayan Singh</b> acceded to India and Benares State was merged into Uttar Pradesh in 1949.</blockquote><a href="/state/benares-state">Benares State</a></li></ul></section>
<section class="enc-where enc-born"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Born and died</h2><p class="enc-born-p">Born in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ramnagar-varanasi">Ramnagar</a>, in what is now <a href="/countries/india">India</a>. <span class="enc-born-src">Places as Wikidata records them.</span></p><figure class="st-locator enc-loc"><a href="/atlas?at=25.27,83.03&amp;year=1974" aria-label="Ramnagar on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="6750 1234 900 540" role="img" aria-label="Map: the birthplace of Vibhuti Narayan Singh"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M7200 1504h0"/><path class="map-dot-me" d="M7200 1504h0"/></svg></a><figcaption>The dot marks the birthplace. <a href="/atlas?at=25.27,83.03&amp;year=1974">What was here in 1974? &rarr;</a></figcaption></figure></section>
